From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS Blink clipboard: UTI conformance matching and trusted pasteboard snapshot

ClipboardIOS::GetAllAvailableFormats previously compared literal pasteboard item
keys without checking UTType conformance, causing iOS plain text stored under
public.utf8-plain-text to miss ClipboardFormatType::PlainTextType()
(public.plain-text). In addition, RenderWidgetUIView -paste: dispatched edit
commands asynchronously so subsequent Blink clipboard reads ran outside UIKit's
trusted paste action and triggered OS paste confirmation prompts.

Add UTType conformance matching across ClipboardIOS format probing and reads,
link UniformTypeIdentifiers.framework on iOS, add Clipboard::PrepareForPaste()
called synchronously inside -[RenderWidgetUIView paste:] to snapshot the
pasteboard with a short TTL, and accept URLs and images in canPerformAction:.

